<mxCell id="c4" value="Both features post to a hard-coded http://10.0.2.2:3000 dev server (the Mac, as seen from an emulator; cleartext is blocked in release builds). Without it the chat answers from a local rules-based fallback and the voice note returns a canned sentence. The app never requests RECORD_AUDIO at runtime, so on a real phone the microphone records nothing." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#334155;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60.0" y="66.0" width="2210.0" height="21.6" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
